WEBVTT

00:39:30.704 --> 00:39:34.079
I began on a backpacking novice.
I became a backpacking expert.

00:39:34.496 --> 00:39:38.621
I thought that I couldn't
do that. And I did.

00:39:38.829 --> 00:39:44.579
I over and over and over again said
to myself, I can't go on. I can't.

00:39:45.163 --> 00:39:48.788
And I always did. And then that
becomes part of who you are.

00:39:48.996 --> 00:39:51.163
It becomes part of the story
you tell yourself.

00:39:51.163 --> 00:39:56.204
So then, you know, 10 years later,
you're in labor.

00:39:56.413 --> 00:40:01.329
As I was trying to give birth to my eleven
pound baby boy and I was thinking,